{parent=Neuroscience bibliography}
{c}

https://www.cdph.ca.gov/Programs/CID/DCDC/CDPH%20Document%20Library/NeurosyphilisGuide.pdf

Late Neurosyphilis: general paresis, mental change, tremor, speech, pupil and reflex findings.

